---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
---

<Layout title="HEX Design Labs" description="HEX Design Labs provides small business website design, website refreshes, website support, content updates, and practical website management for owners who need help keeping their site clear and current.">
	<Hero />
	<main class="home">
		<section class="section">
			<p class="eyebrow">What We Do</p>
			<h2>Website design, website support, and practical management for small businesses that need things handled.</h2>
			<p class="section-intro">
				HEX Design Labs helps small business owners, service providers, and local teams shape websites that are easier to understand, easier to update, and more useful for everyday customer questions. The focus is simple: clear pages, straightforward calls to action, flexible support, and a website that feels aligned with the business behind it.
			</p>

			<div class="cards">
				<a href="/services" class="card">
					<h3>Website Design</h3>
					<p>Clean, modern small business website design for companies that need a professional online presence, clear service information, and a structure that supports future updates.</p>
				</a>

				<a href="/services" class="card">
					<h3>Website Management</h3>
					<p>Ongoing website support for owners who need help with content updates, small page changes, routine site care, and practical improvements over time.</p>
				</a>

				<a href="/services" class="card">
					<h3>Marketing Support</h3>
					<p>Design and content support for service pages, landing pages, website copy cleanup, promotional graphics, and customer-facing materials that need to feel consistent.</p>
				</a>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="highlight">
			<div>
				<p class="eyebrow">Website Management</p>
				<h2>Your website should not become another thing you have to babysit.</h2>
				<p>
					Many small business websites start strong and then slowly become outdated, confusing, or hard to keep current. HEX provides website help for businesses that need a steady partner for updates, maintenance, page improvements, and support after launch, without turning every small change into a separate project.
				</p>
			</div>

			<a href="/services" class="button primary">Learn More</a>
		</section>

		<section class="section">
			<p class="eyebrow">Who We Help</p>
			<h2>Built for practical businesses that need clear, credible websites.</h2>
			<p class="section-intro">
				Whether the need is a new business website, a website refresh, a clearer services page, or ongoing website management, the work is shaped around how real customers look for information. That might mean cleaner navigation, stronger service descriptions, better contact paths, or content that explains what the business does without making visitors dig.
			</p>

			<div class="pill-grid">
				<span>Small Businesses</span>
				<span>Law Firms</span>
				<span>Restaurants & Bars</span>
				<span>Construction</span>
				<span>MSPs</span>
				<span>Salons</span>
				<span>Daycares</span>
				<span>Pet Groomers</span>
				<span>Manufacturing</span>
				<span>Service Businesses</span>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="cta">
			<h2>Need help with your website?</h2>
			<p>Share what feels outdated, unclear, unfinished, or hard to manage. HEX can help sort through the next practical step and whether a website refresh, new page, or ongoing support makes sense.</p>
			<a href="/contact" class="button primary">Start the Conversation</a>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap');
.home {
	max-width: 1120px;
	margin: 0 auto;
	padding: 72px 24px;
	color: var(--color-text);
	font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;

	}

	.eyebrow {
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--color-muted);
		margin-bottom: 16px;
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.8rem);
		line-height: 0.95;
		margin: 0 0 24px;
		letter-spacing: -0.06em;
		color: var(--color-text)
		
	}

	h2 {
		font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
		line-height: 1;
		margin: 0 0 20px;
		letter-spacing: -0.045em;
		color: var(--color-text)
	}

	h3 {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		margin: 0 0 12px;
		color: var(--color-text);
	}

	p {
		font-size: 1rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
		color: var(--color-body);
		margin: 0;
	}

	.section-intro {
		max-width: 780px;
		margin-top: 18px;
	}

	.hero-text {
		font-size: 1.18rem;
		max-width: 680px;
	}

	.hero {
		margin-bottom: 40px;
	}

	.hero-buttons {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 14px;
		margin-top: 32px;
	}

	.button {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		border-radius: 999px;
		padding: 14px 22px;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 700;
		transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
		border: none;
		outline: none;
		box-shadow: none;
	}

	.button:focus,
	.button:focus-visible {
		outline: none;
	}

	a:not(.button) {
		color: #54B8ED;
		font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
		font-weight: 700;
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: color 0.3s ease;
	}

	a:not(.button):hover {
		color: #DC4F41;
	}

	.button:hover {
		transform: translateY(-2px);
	}

	.primary {
		background: var(--color-strong);
		color: var(--color-on-surface-light);
		box-shadow: none;
	}

	.secondary {
		background: var(--color-surface-muted);
		color: var(--color-on-surface-dark);
	}

	.section {
		padding: 72px 0;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
	}

	.home > .section:first-child {
		border-top: 0;
	}

	.cards {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: 20px;
		margin-top: 36px;
	}

	.card {
		background: var(--color-surface);
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		border-radius: 24px;
		padding: 28px;
		display: block;
		color: var(--color-text);
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: background 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease, color 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease;
	}

	.card:hover {
		background: var(--color-strong);
		color: var(--color-on-surface-light);
		box-shadow:
			0 0 0 6px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18),
			0 0 34px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.34),
			0 22px 44px rgba(17, 17, 17, 0.22);
		transform: translateY(-8px);
	}

	.card:hover h3,
	.card:hover p {
		color: var(--color-on-surface-light);
	}

	.card p {
		font-weight: 400;
	}

	.highlight {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 32px;
		background: var(--color-surface-muted);
		border-radius: 32px;
		padding: 44px;
		margin: 32px 0;
	}

	.pill-grid {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 12px;
		margin-top: 32px;
	}

	.pill-grid span {
		background: var(--color-surface-muted);
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		border-radius: 999px;
		padding: 10px 16px;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--color-on-surface-dark);
	}

	.cta {
		text-align: center;
		background: var(--color-strong);
		color: var(--color-on-surface-light);
		border-radius: 36px;
		padding: 64px 24px;
		margin-top: 56px;
	}

	.cta h2 {
		color: var(--color-on-surface-light);
	}

	.cta p {
		color: var(--color-on-muted);
		margin-bottom: 28px;
	}

	.cta .primary {
		background: var(--color-on-surface-light);
		color: var(--color-on-surface-dark);
	}

	@media (max-width: 800px) {
		.cards,
		.highlight {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.home {
			padding: 40px 18px;
		}

		.hero {
			padding: 48px 0 64px;
		}
	}
</style>
